- File: `courses/optyka-vs-sar-porownawcza-wizja-komputerowa/lessons/speckle-dlaczego-to-nie-jest-szum-gaussowski.json` — passes `LessonSchema.safeParse`.
- **7 sections** (2 theory beats + 5 widgets, exactly the upper widget budget):
  1. `theory` — intuition + multiplicative model `I = R·N` with inline Sentinel-1 speckle closeup
  2. `plotImage` — additive vs multiplicative noise comparison (clean / +Gauss / ×Gamma) with histograms
  3. `quiz` — multi-select on speckle misconceptions (PSNR/medianBlur/coherent-imaging)
